{
  "_about": "Patient journey as a finite state machine. Read by backend/fsm.py and web/app/js/fsm.js. Only transitions listed here change the stage; any other event is recorded in the history and ignored. 'declined' is soft the first time (becomes not_now with intent declined, offer again in 3 months), see soft_decline. Events: send (invitation sent, manual or automatic), nurse (contact plan hands over to the nurse), interested, callback, booked (patient booked or nurse referred, 01196), not_now (patient: not now; nurse: unreachable), declined, opt_out (STOP, always hard), no_show (referred but did not go), ldct, result, exclude / include (doctor). result is not final: after a negative result the patient is invited again when the next LDCT is due (2 years).",
